{
  "declaredLength": 2256,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "又见面啦！这次我们\n要拍的是尖叫恐慌的画面。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53C889C197625566FF018FD96B2162114EEC000A898162CD7684662F5C1653EB6050614C7684753B9762300200100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "古代的宝可梦竟然在\n现代复活，四处大闹！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53E44EE376845B9D53EF68A67ADF71365728000A73B04EE3590D6D3BFF0C56DB5904592795F9FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为此我希望能够拍摄\n被称为古代王者的怪颚龙……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A6B6462115E0C671B80FD591F62CD6444000A88AB79F04E3A53E44EE3738B80057684602A989A9F992026202600100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但好像需要将它\n从昂贵的化石中复原才行！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46597D50CF970089815C065B83000A4ECE66028D357684531677F34E2D590D539F624D884CFF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以我一直在等你！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE562114E0076F457287B494F60FF01FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我问你！如果能从化石复原宝宝暴龙，\n并让它进化成怪颚龙的话，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n可以带它来帮忙拍摄吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621195EE4F60FF015982679C80FD4ECE531677F3590D539F5B9D5B9D66B49F99FF0C000A5E768BA95B838FDB53166210602A989A9F9976848BDDFF0C00100001BE00000A53EF4EE55E265B8367655E2E5FD962CD64445417FF1F00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这次我会让你也作为\n临时演员参演的！拜托啦！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD96B2162114F1A8BA94F604E5F4F5C4E3A000A4E3465F66F14545853C26F147684FF0162DC62585566FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果你愿意帮忙拍摄的话，\n就把怪颚龙放到同行队伍中吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C4F60613F610F5E2E5FD962CD644476848BDDFF0C000A5C31628A602A989A9F99653E5230540C884C961F4F0D4E2D5427FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没预算的话是没法拍的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CA198847B9776848BDD662F6CA16CD562CD7684300200100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "古代的宝可梦，\n我可从来没见过……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53E44EE376845B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A621153EF4ECE67656CA189C18FC72026202600100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "难道说你真的把怪颚龙带来了！？\n你愿意来帮忙拍摄吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96BE90538BF44F60771F7684628A602A989A9F995E2667654E86FF01FF1F000A4F60613F610F67655E2E5FD962CD64445417FF1F00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "当然！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F537136FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD8662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呜……这样的话，我这个导演\n只好穿上布偶装亲自出演了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "545C202620268FD9683776848BDDFF0C62118FD94E2A5BFC6F14000A53EA597D7A7F4E0A5E03507688C54EB281EA51FA6F144E86FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我就知道你会来的！\n当临时演员时，你也要好好发挥哦！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115C3177E590534F604F1A67657684FF01000A5F534E3465F66F14545865F6FF0C4F604E5F8981597D597D53D1632554E6FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "大家，拜托了！\n预备……Action！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59275BB6FF0C62DC62584E86FF01000A98845907202620260041006300740069006F006EFF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嘿……快看！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "563F202620265FEB770BFF0100100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怪隆～～～！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "602A9686FF5EFF5EFF5EFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那是什么……？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A3662F4EC04E4820262026FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怪……怪兽！？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "602A20262026602A517DFF01FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它要来这边了！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B83898167658FD98FB94E86FF01FF0100100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "叽怪～～～",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53FD602AFF5EFF5EFF5E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "CUT！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004300550054FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它怎么跟主人撒娇了！？\n形象都毁啦！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B83600E4E488DDF4E3B4EBA64925A074E86FF01FF1F000A5F628C6190FD6BC15566FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那个……导演。\n别看怪颚龙这样子，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n它好像能学会撒娇这招哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E2A202620265BFC6F143002000A522B770B602A989A9F998FD968375B50FF0C00100001BE00000A5B83597D50CF80FD5B664F1A64925A078FD962DB54E6300200100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看来它即使性情暴躁，\n在训练家面前也是娇滴滴的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B67655B8353734F7F602760C566B48E81FF0C000A57288BAD7EC35BB69762524D4E5F662F5A076EF46EF47684300200100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "什么！？\n原来它不能和主人共同出演啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EC04E48FF01FF1F000A539F67655B834E0D80FD548C4E3B4EBA5171540C51FA6F14554AFF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过，等一下哦。\n与人类心意相通的古代的宝可梦……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC7FF0C7B494E004E0B54E63002000A4E0E4EBA7C7B5FC3610F76F8901A768453E44EE376845B9D53EF68A62026202600100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这样也不错嘛！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD968374E5F4E0D9519561BFF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "导演，这样真的行吗？\n每次都跟预定的不一样啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BFC6F14FF0C8FD96837771F7684884C5417FF1F000A6BCF6B2190FD8DDF98845B9A76844E0D4E006837554A300200100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呵呵……无需担心！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "547554752026202665E0970062C55FC3FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这个系列的主题已经\n不是“野生宝可梦的可怕之处”了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94E2A7CFB521776844E3B98985DF27ECF000A4E0D662F201C91CE751F5B9D53EF68A6768453EF60154E4B5904201D4E86FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而是“与野生宝可梦的共生”！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C662F201C4E0E91CE751F5B9D53EF68A676845171751F201DFF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "到现在为止拍到的那些温馨画面\n全都与这个主题一致！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "523073B057284E3A6B6262CD5230768490A34E9B6E2999A8753B9762000A516890FD4E0E8FD94E2A4E3B98984E0081F4FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "比起单纯地表现它们有多可怕，\n这样拍不是更适合现在的密阿雷吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 1892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BD48D7753557EAF5730886873B05B834EEC6709591A53EF6015FF0C000A8FD9683762CD4E0D662F66F49002540873B0572876845BC6963F96F75417FF1F00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好嘞……！\n这绝对会火起来的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 1964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D561E20262026FF01000A8FD97EDD5BF94F1A706B8D7767657684FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我能这么大胆地转换方向也是多亏了你！\n感谢你哦！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621180FD8FD94E48592780C657308F6C636265B954114E5F662F591A4E8F4E864F60FF01000A611F8C224F6054E6FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿(",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "描写与宝可梦共生的电影……\n这绝对会火起来的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "63CF51994E0E5B9D53EF68A65171751F768475355F7120262026000A8FD97EDD5BF94F1A706B8D7767657684FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "本来我觉得……能拿到报酬就好，\n但跟那个导演混，是成不了明星的啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "672C6765621189C95F972026202680FD62FF523062A5916C5C31597DFF0C000A4F468DDF90A34E2A5BFC6F146DF7FF0C662F62104E0D4E86660E661F7684554A300200100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不只是怪颚龙，\n所有的宝可梦都很可爱。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D53EA662F602A989A9F99FF0C000A6240670976845B9D53EF68A690FD5F8853EF7231300200100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    }
  ],
